      "created_at": "2017-03-03T18:36:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ravenloft is a perfect setting for a Van Helsing style monster hunter. &nbsp;Ranger can work really well to reflect that; a few arcane 'tricks' to aid in combat, favored enemy (undead), and a combat style of your choice. &nbsp;Bonus points if your GM lets you reskin a bow or crossbow as a blunderbuss.</p>",
