      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-03-04T15:32:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Do you want to play someone who succumbs to evil?&nbsp;Or someone who confronts it? In the 5<sup>th</sup> Ed version, that will be important. Your character’s personality and interests are going to significantly influence how they progress through the story.</p><p>Of course, it also depends on how your GM is using it. Are they running the adventure as-written? (If so, I’m very sorry... ![](upload://6Z1N3sPPr4mb8Xlhog5I831C8IK.gif)) Are they inserting it into an existing campaign structure/concept?&nbsp;</p>",
